          </button>
        </h2>
        <div class="details" id="answer-2" aria-labelledby="question-2">
          <p>Most healthy adult cats do well with measured meals once or twice a day, though the right amount depends on age, activity level, and the food itself. Fresh water should always be available, and your veterinarian can help fine-tune portions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

